---
/**
 * Schedule section - upcoming circle dates and topics
 */
---

<section id="terminy" class="section" aria-labelledby="terminy-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col two-col--reverse">
      <div>
        <h2 id="terminy-title">Terminy a miesta</h2>
        <hr class="divider" />
        <p class="schedule__dates">
          Temy, terminy a miesta putovneho kruhu.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="schedule__image-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/image02.jpg"
          alt="Fiktivna mapa stretnuti"
          class="rounded-img"
          width="450"
          height="450"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider--wide" />

    <div class="schedule__next card">
      <p class="schedule__label">Najblizsi kruh</p>
      <div class="schedule__meta">
        <p><strong>Kedy:</strong> 4. 3. 2026 17:30</p>
        <p><strong>Kde:</strong> Babi doly</p>
        <p><strong>Tema: Akou si chystam buducnost?</strong></p>
      </div>
      <p>
        V tomto case, ked sa priroda pomaly chysta na novy zaciatok, je to
        otazka, ktora ide priamo do hlbky.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sucastou vecera bude opat aj moznost skocit do vody (povinne len pre
        odvaznych) a samozrejme ohen, ktory je uz takmer nasou povinnostou
        &ndash; tou najlepsou, aka moze byt.
      </p>
      <p>
        Okrajovo sa mozeme dotyknut aj toho, ako do nasich planov vstupuje svet
        technologii a AI, ktory potichku meni pravidla hry.
      </p>
      <p class="schedule__questions-label"><u>Otazky na spolocne zamyslenie a zdielanie:</u></p>
      <ul class="styled-list">
        <li>Viem vobec, co chcem?</li>
        <li>Alebo ma viac zamestnavaju obavy z toho, co pride?</li>
        <li>Pozeram sa na detaily, alebo na celkovy obraz svojej cesty?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="schedule__upcoming">
      <p class="schedule__meta-line">
        <strong>18. 3. 2026 17:30</strong> &ndash; ???
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="schedule__cta">Pridaj sa?</p>
    <p>
      Na WhatsApp skupine mozes dat svoje slovo, ze sa zucastnis. Pripadne
      potvrď svoju ucast priamo cez SMS na cislo v paticke.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .schedule__image-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .schedule__image-wrap img {
    max-width: 15rem;
    height: auto;
  }

  .schedule__next {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .schedule__label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .schedule__meta {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .schedule__meta p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .schedule__questions-label {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .schedule__upcoming {
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .schedule__meta-line {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .schedule__cta {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm) !important;
  }
</style>
